        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present this three-bedroom detached residence, ideally situated in the peaceful countryside of Realtogue, just on the outskirts of Navan town. Set in a scenic rural location while remaining within easy reach of all the amenities of Navan, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home with space, privacy and plenty of potential.\n\nExtending to approximately 92 sq. m., the property is set on a generous site with a spacious garden to the side, providing ample outdoor space and excellent potential for gardening, entertaining or family use. The property also benefits from two useful outbuildings, offering valuable additional storage and a range of possible uses depending on the needs of the new owner.\n\nThe property is in need of some modernisation and upgrading, but this is where much of its appeal lies. For the right buyer, this could be an ideal project, offering the opportunity to put their own stamp on a detached home in a beautiful countryside setting. With the right vision and investment, there is considerable potential to create a comfortable and characterful family home while retaining the peaceful rural surroundings.\n\nThe location offers an excellent balance between country living and convenience. Navan town is approximately 10 minutes away by car, providing an extensive range of amenities including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, pubs, shops, medical facilities and a wide selection of sporting and recreational facilities. Navan Shopping Centre, Aura Leisure Centre, Navan Racecourse and the River Boyne are all easily accessible from the property.\n\nThe nearby village of Kentstown is also within easy reach and provides a range of local amenities, including a primary school, local shops, pubs and community facilities. The property is also conveniently positioned for access to the surrounding villages and towns, including Slane, Duleek, Dunshaughlin and Drogheda.\n\nFor commuters, the property benefits from excellent access to the wider road network, with the M3 motorway providing a direct route towards Dublin and the M50. Dublin city centre can be reached in approximately 5060 minutes by car, depending on traffic, while Dublin Airport is also readily accessible.\n\nCombining a peaceful countryside setting with convenient access to Navan, Kentstown and Dublin, this property represents an exciting opportunity for someone looking for a detached home that they can modernise and make their own. With its generous garden, two outbuildings and excellent potential, Realtogue could be the perfect project for the right buyer.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the setting and potential this property has to offer."
      },
